  "//overrides-qs": "qs is held at a floor of 6.17.1, the release that carries the qs.stringify fix (patched from 6.16.1). express 5.3.0 now declares ^6.16.0 and body-parser 2.4.0 declares ^6.16.1, so the old ~6.15.1 tilde block is gone; the override stays as a floor so no lockfile refresh can resolve below the patched version. cloudgrid runs this same override in packages/api and functions/event-consumer through the identical pins. REMOVE once express declares a qs range whose floor is >= 6.16.1: npm view express dependencies.qs . See cloudgrid-io/cloudgrid#4346.",
